[ /* restrictions */
],
[ /* expiration outcomes */

],
)>>

:: Quest_promising_dominatrix [nobr]
<p>
    Rumors are circulating in the <<lore region_city>>. They say in the seedy underbelly where women are regularly selling their bodies, there is a stand-out new dominatrix on the scene. She's rising in popularity, with a few nobles already having been caught seeing her in secret. If she really is as good as they say, she may make one hell of a slaver. You might consider booking a session with her and sending a slaver to convince her to join you.
</p>



